<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of June 13, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						June 13  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,155  1,021   1,746</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 44     48	51</p>
<p>CCC					    1,127  1,277   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  2,326  2,346   3,103</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,150  1,138     630</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				185    185     275</p>
<p>CCC						758  2,108   1,959</p>
<p>TOTAL					  2,493  3,431   2,864</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
